# Windows scripts must keep CRLF endings.
#
# cmd.exe does not reliably resolve `goto` and labels in a batch file saved with
# Unix line endings, and this launcher is built entirely on them — so a checkout
# that "helpfully" normalised these to LF would ship a menu where every choice
# silently falls through. Learned the hard way.
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf
*.bat  text eol=crlf
